{title: 309 - I Surrender All}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #309 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 309}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]All to [G]Je[D]sus [A7]I surrender; [D]all to [G]Him I [A]freely [D]give;
[D]I will [G]e-v[D]er [A7]love and trust him, [D]in His [G]presence [A]daily [D]live.
[D]I surrender [A7]all, I surrender [D]all,
[D]All to [G]thee, [D]my [D]blessed Savio[G]r, [D]I sur[A]render [D]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[D][G]I [D]surrender [A7]all, [D][G]I [A]surrender [D]all,
[D][G]all [D]to [A7]thee, [D][G]my [A]blessed [D]Savior,
[D]I [A7]surrender [D]all.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D][G]All [D][A7]to [D]Jesus [G][A]I [D]surrender;
[D][G]humbly [D]at [A7]his [D][G]feet [A]I [D]bow,
[D]worldly [A7]pleasures [D]all forsaken;
[D][G]take [D]me, [D]Jesus, [G][D]take [A]me [D]now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D][G]All [D][A7]to [D]Jesus [G][A]I [D]surrender;
[D][G]make [D][A7]me, [D]Savior, [G][A]wholly [D]thine;
[D]fill me [A7]with thy [D]love and power;
[D][G]truly [D]know [D]that [G][D]thou [A]art [D]mine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D][G]All [D][A7]to [D]Jesus [G][A]I [D]surrender;
[D][G]now [D]I [A7]feel [D][G]the [A]sacred [D]flame.
[D]O the [A7]joy of [D]full salvation!
[D][G]Glory, [D][D]glory, [G]to [D][A]his [D]name!
{end_of_verse}
